# Anchored to the repo ROOT only — this ignores the STALE root-level /ios
# prebuild artifact (see apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md), NOT the authoritative
# apps/mobile/ios/ project, whose generated files (Pods, build, DerivedData)
# are covered by apps/mobile/ios/.gitignore. Unanchored `ios/` matched
# apps/mobile/ios/ too, which blocked NEW tracked native files like the
# regenerated app-icon PNG from being committed.
